  articleID: https://OskarsUpdates/Recents
  title: Oskar Slap !
  headliner: <b>Top Actor Strikes Host Mid-Ceremony Over Audience Joke !</b>
  bodyText: "The New Manila Theatre erupted into total confusion tonight during the
    ongoing Oskars broadcast after top nominee Bill Smith stormed the stage and struck
    host Chris Brock across the face following an unscripted joke about his wife.
    \r\n\r\nMore about this story :\r\n"
  externalLinkBodyText: 'The New Manila Theatre erupted into total confusion tonight
    during the ongoing "Oskars" broadcast after top nominee Bill Smith stormed the
    stage and struck host Chris Block across the face following an unscripted joke
    about his wife. Shocked attendees initially assumed the sudden confrontation
    was a rehearsed comedy bit until Smith returned to his front-row seat and repeatedly
    shouted expletives at the presenter. '
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - That's gonna leave a mark.
  - I JUST saw that on TV earlier !
  - NAH, NOT MY CHRIS, NOT MY BROCK.
  - HARDER, YEAHHHHH, HARDER !
